index 81dd7df8..cf85e189 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -18,6 +18,10 @@ Unreleased
     part of the HTTP spec. :pr:`3092`
 -   ``EnvironBuilder.close`` closes all open files in ``files`` rather than only
     the first for each key. :pr:`3092`
+-   Added the ``subdomain_matching`` parameter to ``Map``. ``bind_to_environ``
+    only detects the subdomain relative to ``server_name`` if it is enabled.
+    Previously the subdomain was always detected, which restricted routing to
+    the configured ``server_name`` even without subdomain rules.
 
 
 Version 3.1.5
